      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DENISE'S GAL (7) has her hoof on the till after eight starts and is ready to win fifth-up. Showed plenty of early speed before being nailed late in a tight finish when fourth over 1210m at Moruya. Gets map favours again today and she finds a very ordinary contest. Go close. LET UP (4) Astern gelding from Modesty on debut for the Pat Murphy yard. Latest trial had merit when saluting over 750m at Goulburn. Lugging bit goes on and gets every chance from the good gate. DEVIL DANCER (3) Captivant gelding from the handy producer Devil Miss on debut for the Jarrod Austin stable. Looks ready to go after placing in his latest trial over 740m at Warwick Farm. Each-way. SILVER SUMMIT (2) three-year-old D'argento gelding out of Terminally Pretty on debut for the Joseph Ible yard. Did offer much when last in his trial over 800m at Illawarra Grange. Improver under race conditions.",
